{
  "rationale": "Use a small plant split into sensing and motion capability, then encode the exploration policy in specifications. The policy gives clear priority to forward progress in clear space, uses short directed turns for side/front obstacles, allows a rare one-shot backward escape only from a dedicated front-obstacle recovery path, and reserves full_rotate for a dedicated last-resort stuck state after repeated front blockage. Action states are one-shot, and uncontrollable events are total in all specification states.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate environment sensing from motion capability in G so E can impose safe perception-to-action bindings cleanly.",
    "Bias toward coverage by making clear/path_clear lead to move_forward, using random_walk only as a secondary exploration mode, and returning to forward exploration immediately after recovery when path_clear is observed."
  ],
